# Old /employer/technology-hiring/.../hire-X/ → new /hire/X-india pages
RedirectMatch 301 ^/employer/technology-hiring(?:__trashed)?/hire-developers-programmers/hire-ai-engineers/?$  /hire/ai-engineers-india
RedirectMatch 301 ^/employer/technology-hiring(?:__trashed)?/hire-developers-programmers/hire-machine-learning-engineers/?$  /hire/machine-learning-engineers-india
